<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Apple a 'speculative buy'.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Apple a 'speculative buy'.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert M. Cohen &amp; Co said it initiated coverage of Apple Computer Inc with a speculative buy rating and set an 18-month price target of $32 per share.</p>
<p>-- said that despite the current turmoil at the company, analyst Keith Bossey sees 1998 as a &quot;year of rebirth for Apple.&quot;</p>
<p>-- shares were up one at 17-7/16.</p>
</text>
